{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060403/block/singleImage/3249045/wm/01M5VZNEBESQVBS7XBSFJ1KYD5.jpeg?updatedAt=1793014539\"/><figcaption>消防即時派出「飛將軍」趕往現場展開救援。(鍾式明攝)</figcaption></figure><p>今日（26日）傍晚6時15分，警方接獲康樂廣場1號怡和大廈保安報案，指兩名工人於大廈外牆進行工程期間，所乘坐的吊船疑突然向下滑落，導致兩人被困於30多樓的高空「半天吊」，情況萬分危急。 警方及救援人員接報後不敢怠慢，消防即時派出「飛將軍」趕往現場展開救援，救護車亦在地面戒備。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:41:00.695578+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:20:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:58:06.668419+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T12:38:16.534273+00:00","content_hash":"8aba9f43c4733d9e4f8bf961460b7ccc14db9f3abd1bd2d0e37752f670c5a010","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:41:00.695578+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}